    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build an island</h2>Build your own island from simple building blocks. Will you make your island hilly or flat? Will it have dense forests or dry deserts?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Design a racetrack</h2>Decide how many turns your island racetrack will have. Your racetrack follows the path that you design. Will you make your racetrack straight and simple or full of twists and turns?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Race!</h2>Choose your favorite car and start racing. You will set the first time record for speeding around your racetrack. Will your friends be able to beat your record? How about other racers?<br><br><strong>Build. Design. Race!</strong>",
